                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "This model was built using inputs specific to your organization: 1,200 nursing FTEs across 350 staffed beds, 104,755 patient days annually, and 60% Abridge utilization. The base-case estimate is $7.64M in annual value against $1.05M in annual investment — 7.3× Year 1 ROI. Every value line is formula-driven, source-cited, and auditable to the rows below. Hard value lines (Workforce) run on your specific headcount, cost, and utilization data. Potential value lines (Quality) apply published incidence rates with conservative documentation-attributable prevention fractions. Where Abridge deployment averages are used as defaults, they reflect medians from live implementations and can be replaced with your institutional data.",
