                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "The HCAHPS responsiveness and communication domains are the two highest-weighted nursing-sensitive items in the CMS Value-Based Purchasing formula. Nurses with more time at the bedside — time reclaimed from documentation burden — may score better on both. VBP adjustments compound annually: a 0.5-point HCAHPS improvement at scale can shift the payment multiplier across the Medicare inpatient book.",
